%% Phase1 / schedule / MV3-G04d 查询定时消息
%% 机器真源: phase1.manifest.json；Helix im_get_schedule/read.rs/dispatch_read.rs；Go posts/getSchedule；Angular schedule projection
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Angular schedule bar
  participant P as MessageV3ImGate
  participant T as Tauri im_get_schedule
  participant H as Helix Tick / outbound read
  participant G as Go IM Server
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as Angular schedule signal
  UI->>P: getSchedule(channelId)
  P->>T: invokeResult im_get_schedule
  T->>H: Tick::Command(req_id,channelId)
  H->>G: Effect::Http GET /api/cses/posts/getSchedule
  G-->>H: schedule projection or null
  H->>H: Tick::PortReply(Http Ok) / correlate req_id
  H->>B: Effect::Emit im:read:result
  B->>S: resolve schedule read waiter
  S-->>UI: render message/type/props/schedulePostAt or empty
  Note over H,B: 只读 Gate 不写 SQLite/Go PostgreSQL，不等待 WS；HTTP 2xx 不等于已渲染
